cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Trano in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Trano: automated generation of Modelica building energy simulation models"
abstract: >-
  Trano is a Python package that generates building energy simulation models in Modelica
  (Buildings, IDEAS, AixLib, FastSmoothBuildings) from a YAML, JSON or RDF description of the
  building, its HVAC systems and their controls. The generated models are validated against
  ASHRAE Standard 140 (BESTEST) and can be translated to CasADi for model predictive control.
